  <item>
    <title>8.奈良、宇治、和歌山：走进日本佛教的兴衰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6683e1efcdd230b23bb7e991</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6683e1efcdd230b23bb7e991</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 11:18:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宇治作为抹茶的代名词，似乎自带一层清新的滤镜，但不止抹茶的清香，这里的人心也经历过末法时代笼罩下的苦涩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>奈良因平成时代鉴真大师数十载东渡，不惜双目失明带来的佛教，与日本本土的神道教在此相处千余年而闻名，青岸渡寺与熊野那智大社至今虽仍比肩而立，却尽是波谲云诡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与满怀古韵的奈良城不同，和歌山以及纪伊胜浦似乎更少被人熟知，但这里有着紧挨太平洋的洞穴温泉，被称为日本最美的温泉之一。同时，熊野古道散布于纪伊山地的灵场，与西班牙的“圣雅各之路”一同被指定为世界遗产，并称“世界上仅有两条的道路”而闻名世界。请大家随着吨吨和猫老师的视角，在关西的最后几天一同享受一场人文与身体上的双重盛宴。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>宇治/抹茶/奈良时代与大唐遗风/伊藤久右卫门/中村藤吉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>10元硬币背后平等院/佛教中的末法时代/夏威夷平等院/凤凰堂中的大佛/敦煌韵味</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FviZRjLagWHargLn6ebotzShqm5V.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>凤凰堂</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>日本的《红楼梦》：《源氏物语》/作者紫式部/招魂幡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0LK2zd3_cR0aw8E3dPF8V4wqtS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>宇治川风景</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>抹茶冰淇淋/抹茶面条清新/抹茶啤酒/抹茶饼干/抹茶工艺的来源</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjxiZMR-QheXauhKgu8hf-b92q7t.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>宇治街拍</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>奈良/唐招提寺/白江口海战/落架大修/书法作品/空海和尚与吉备真备</span></p><span></span><p><span>创造日文/晁衡归乡的波折/鉴真和尚六次东渡终成功/双目失明/传授戒律/山川异域风月同天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>东大寺/镰仓时代的南大门/大佛殿/带有小洞的柱子/哼哈二将</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1RArSQnnGUZBclaaBvMl07H3-w.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>宏伟的东大寺</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>奈良公园的小鹿/鹿仙贝/小鹿袭击猫老师</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg17oPeKdItZSZNuEgfGT4N4TJ1n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>若草山公园/下午五点就关门</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0IdD8FK0d6D3zKCNbgs14Dt_ZI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>山顶日落</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>和歌山/小玉站长拯救铁路线/四种主题的列车/巧思明信片/小猫神社/沿线居民的通勤列车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgKPqgiEc0qOf6Sl5ic9SBFBfsRo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>二玉值班中</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FidLKg42kJIhy4Xp1bfj2-EBqyni.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>博物馆号内部</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvH8s4Hcivv4JSSzBn7RubP6jpF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>明信片集章</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>纪伊胜浦/浦岛酒店/闲适的乌龟船/日式榻榻米房间/毗邻太平洋的洞窟温泉/孩童性别意识堪忧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtI-_L5WxUCFdhtrofIJSzt_webv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>夜色下的龟龟船</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>熊野三山/大门坂古道/熊野哪只大社与青岸渡寺/神佛习合/明治维新废佛毁释/神道教成为国教/黑船来航/大政奉还/改宗制度后神儒二教归佛教管辖/僧人骄奢淫逸/神道教与佛教的地位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2553">42:33</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>千年历史樟树/天然凹洞/圣树富有灵气/龙猫八百万神明/破墓/那智瀑布/宗教意义/飞泷神社/</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-b90VWjCIfqfymV8ZWi-kLMw10.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>那智瀑布与三重塔</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>那智高原公园/胆怯的野生小鹿/没有现金吃饭的窘迫/金枪鱼盖饭/野菜饭团/金枪鱼分割拍卖/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3002">50:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>瑞可爷爷蛋糕/银座仁志川/抹茶酱/大阪梅田站设计太复杂了没买到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3202">53:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Haruka的Hello Kitty专列/难寻的站台/旅途的遗憾</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llwUJTsIU0BLc0REfnRIJueiv0Oh.m4a" length="56370361" type="audio/mp4"/>
