  <item>
    <title>7.大阪之问：死了可以上任天堂吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667ebcab5c33fe90f5873cf9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667ebcab5c33fe90f5873cf9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 13:37:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从大阪的环球影城开始，在马里奥园区中，游戏和现实世界在这里没有了隔阂，发动卡丁车，和吨吨一起同马里奥在彩虹大道上赛车一决高下，伸出手划破次元，和猫老师在鹤桥轻轻感受流淌过的时间吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大阪城天守阁//丰臣秀吉与朱元璋//柯南//Time Capsule</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgCoIQh1Xzs6GPQGeTqwwwzHrCC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大阪历史博物馆//难波城//绝佳观景</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FucCD9-ioPWPtmA1sYz2ccKbuQEB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大阪环球影城</span></p><span></span><p><span>//在哈利波特禁忌之旅骑上扫帚和哈利来一场酣畅淋漓的魁地奇比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span>//悬吊空中像鹰马一样飞行</span></p><span></span><p><span>任天堂园区</span></p><span></span><p><span>//从AR装具望远镜中远眺城堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>//和酷霸王在马里奥赛车里一决高下//细节满满的酷霸王书房</span></p><span></span><p><span>//从五个小游戏中集齐三把钥匙挑战BOSS</span></p><span></span><p><span>//奇诺比奥咖啡厅//耀西零食店</span></p><span></span><p><span>//傲娇的奇诺比奥//倒着走的过山车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiP2Aa-nV7Qw9zQr_aRHvyd6qIi-.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUB4LiNh21IotCXO2XpIgIDPPxY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHWBdItc3-5UpMXiQDfF682oMxS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_uf_nET8BbSguSWZqhSM6cyjnH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlDodylSjxCJOpN2yOiEDg-TYJBF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_z756oYmSGq7Zl4X0PP0jCtsi6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1947">32:27</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>烧鸟店//炸食//茶割清酒//狂饮啤酒//随处垃圾的道顿堀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>鹤桥市场//韩裔聚集区//《弹子球游戏》《柏青哥》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoMsX0YR7agswZdcP8IJTc5hUUkY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi--qptjB2wc0borQgFC4dy242Xu.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
