  <item>
    <title>6.京都探秘：和小千代穿过鸟居，在Round1重启人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66713446c26e396a369d94c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66713446c26e396a369d94c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 07:16:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>京都是日本三大古都之一（镰仓，京都，奈良），也是目前城市建设最先进的，整个城市就像一个巨大的博物馆，随处可见世界文化遗产，和猫老师还有吨吨一起逆转时间的流逝，感受海外盛唐气象，重新回到那个令人神往的朝代。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>伏见稻荷大社 //粗心坐错列车//大阪环状线的离心力//密度极大的城市通勤列车</span></p><span></span><p><span>//电影《破墓》里提到的狐狸</span></p><span></span><p><span>//千本鸟居//祇园/《艺伎回忆录》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnqjM1XBSk60C9-A02KcmJISqhMM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>夜晚阴森森的千鸟居</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtK1CH4Ji2RZRr0rYV6__qTlIZqQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>登顶提示</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lstxQNh-un4N8L_9pJxQJY2rm6Ts.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>给小动物的鸟居</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>清水寺//二年坂三年坂//清水舞台//雷劈大树</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltY42Olp-Ei5V8HAj2SecKgxXonG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltrZ5MQ80Ak4Hx75oSRG5quzLTJT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>清水舞台</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>鸭川</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrCUp33Nu_GT0-6KimEGWnAsmM0w.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>油画鸭川</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>豆乳拉面//酥脆猪排</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuLOKghMDvAMOzKdXsSJNqD8393m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>重启人生剧粉报道！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr322XTWTFmOj2DZ3A20pcATan1u.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>门口标志性的大保龄球</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuvnQCzlryuNH_d7A4ngHJTelwNI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>手忙脚乱的音游</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>京都任天堂旗舰店 //卡比手提包//马里奥金币餐盘//奇诺比奥调味罐//喷喷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftfjpz8lWll83eFhMhEHdFSKtjF2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>健身环挑战</span></em></p>]]></description>
