  <item>
    <title>5.迪拜&amp;阿布扎比：黑袍与白袍下的阿拉伯世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660d3eb74f66d1c1dae012fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660d3eb74f66d1c1dae012fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 11:34:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>吨吨和猫老师的中东旅行为什么在阿联酋拉开了序幕呢？首先是自从我们在普吉岛看到了那位身着黑袍的阿拉伯女士后，便对伊斯兰国家产生了探索欲。其次因为一直在网络上看到关于迪拜和阿布扎比的新闻，差不多都围绕着富裕展开，但好像也就仅限于此了，但我们想一个国家的色彩不应该如此单调，我们想去看看被忽略的部分。最后也与一些离谱的传说有关，诸如拾荒者月入好几万，排队付款速度太慢的话后面人就帮你付了。我们是特别警惕这些反直觉信息的一类人，所以就将阿联酋安排到了这次旅行中，希望我们的眼睛和声音带给各位听众不一样的旅行视角。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>阿联酋行前插曲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a></span><br><span> </span><br><span>迪拜初印象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a></span><br><span>阔气的政府//路怒的司机//打破认知的奇怪24h店铺//烟雾缭绕//猫狗友好//ZOMATO//阔气的店主</span><br><span> </span><br><span>迪拜觅食</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a></span><br><span>肉酱脆饼//船型奶酪披萨//花菜砂锅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a></span><br><span>叙利亚餐厅//店面豪横//油炸蔬菜丸子//桌边的蔬菜//无限供但会回收的餐饼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a></span><br><span>锡金餐厅//食材新鲜//辣咖喱鸡肉饭//印度鸡茸玉米羹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a></span><br><span>PhillySteak//Poutine好吃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoA4cSJQLFd-R0xzc0mI_vlBQqL8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>探秘阿布扎比当地饮食</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a></span><br><span>阿布扎比当地炸鸡//探秘埃及山寨版//肉质紧致的无腥味炸鱼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a></span><br><span>阿布扎比当地早餐店//油饼手抓饼煎蛋//甜菜酱//昂贵的鸡蛋</span><br><span> </span><br><span>看迪拜的过去</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a></span><br><span>卡迪夫街区</span><br><span>旧民居//珠宝香料文字诗歌//建筑材料//</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a></span><br><span>海上生活体验馆</span><br><span>从种树开始教你做一艘船//VR视角随迪拜人一起捞珍珠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a></span><br><span>民俗体验</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fns0wPtzXDFkMCI8548YST0UmdTy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOocOl-0V7sgCIa3O0rpAuUN_xI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>拼贴画//炒咖啡豆</span><img alt="/咖啡" src="https://res.wx.qq.com/mpres/zh_CN/htmledition/comm_htmledition/images/pic/common/pic_blank.gif"><span>拉花//手上刺青</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpyZseqYa_vGsz4dqk1tsB98OuFp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a></span><br><span>阿拉伯香料</span><br><span>香料博物馆//焚香//周五的味道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a></span><br><span>诗歌博物馆</span><br><span>全世界的抒情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a></span><br><span>留言板</span><br><span>纸条交换//中奖的吨吨//吨吨表演才艺</span><br><span> </span><br><span>在迪拜的现在感受浪花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk1ByubVcAWjdbq9gEcyFIAdoG2P.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a></span><br><span>猫老师随想</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a></span><br><span>土耳其剧透</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a></span><br><span>整洁的车厢与埃及对比鲜明//抽烟骂人抠脚吃薯片</span><br><span> </span><br><span>谢赫扎耶德清真寺</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a></span><br><span>纯白外观//着装规定//推荐大家守一下整点的导游//拼接而成的花朵//古兰经渗透到各处//35吨的地毯与12吨的吊灯//每天五次祷告的穆斯林//最奢华的厕所</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lifbsJ4Aswru7hcCZ99h5iY1Plcu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxDXlJj6mtt_V_3oqosdJfv2QwZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltKgOUptIo-nY1HHR3tcpddwyXJ9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqFNiukILtYCBx9QIMRldfuLeuTW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一个博物馆带着吨吨回老家</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a></span><br><span>建筑本身就是艺术品//横向视角对比各国艺术//土耳其瓷器//达芬奇莫奈高更油画//兵器收藏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCz5NOakok0AP04CzCkHChwzh3n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2627">43:47</a></span><br><span>热衷于沙画的猫老师</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl8P7O0Kaog8YkFG8OHyKUIGkU37.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>埃及预告</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2804">46:44</a></span><br><span>跟人打交道不带80个心眼子就会被坑的埃及//每天学习几个不一样的小费要法//PTSD//需要明确的车费维度//口说无凭视频为证//太多了做简介的吨吨打不完了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmzNexmVVeHP6kbNPID0zuj3FsUm.m4a" length="46880049" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvOj5_jzMz0XpwtBByw3vvDWS178.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>4.周末旅行：武汉的生烫也太好吃了吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a9dfc9df5490da4a075f50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a9dfc9df5490da4a075f50</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jan 2024 02:34:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>来到九省通衢的武汉，除了热干面，好吃的还有太多！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里的味道不能简单地用辣或鲜一个字形容，而是像这个城市一样，融合了不同的地域特色，最终变成了独一无二的武汉的味道。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>兰陵路王记生烫的圆粉和通心粉//在明静生烫看热闹//豫楚源美猴王生烫的毛肚印象深刻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsum_uwoZ6OcmxO_bPFXqgdtap_Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>辛香的糊汤粉泡油条//四季美番茄虾仁包以及烧卖没有到期望值//小董豆皮不好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>蔡林记热干面发挥稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次听说的泡蛋苕粉//脆脆的藕条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老高家重油烧咸香油润//吨吨一直复刻的蛋酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>粮道街挺一般//汽水包//冷掉的鸡冠饺//糯米包油条//桂花酥饺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>湖北省博的出入口设计让人恼火//古德寺风格奇特前所未见</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0eesIcV1y8cB51JAXdY06zBU5Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>黄鹤楼旧址随想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>长江大桥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmoIiy63b4CpK8JjFH3LtN8QosFI.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrH1A81YwYjbzVNneblCNg2HH_Do.m4a" length="21111898" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhiffI43fIm5WoEIFZvyoK8s_Mef.png"/>
