  <item>
    <title>3.周末旅行：去南昌吃3元拌粉吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a88fdaab66818faf5b8374</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a88fdaab66818faf5b8374</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jan 2024 02:41:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不能出远门的日子，就去火辣辣的南昌吧，在这里可以各式各样的拌粉吃到饱，也能喝到各种各样鲜香的瓦罐汤......好吃的太多了，下次还要来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>好吃但不便宜的外卖//瓦罐汤外卖真的附送瓦罐//深夜航班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>羊子两室一厅//从冰箱拿出来的油浸鱼//学人精给螃蟹脚加了一份粉//软糯糯的红烧鸡脚//味道还行//热情的服务人员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>江西省博物馆//江西的兴衰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>丽丽水煮的麻球//油炸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>蛤蟆街夜市的炸香蕉//胖子炒粉锅气十足//好喝的皮蛋肉饼汤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiQTQ35q5d68pIw21kvCzcuJnjvJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>深夜亮灯的拌粉店//偷看瓦罐汤的制作过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>错过万寿宫附近排队的老三样//南昌最好吃的老闵田螺//咸香油润的猪油拌饭//鲜甜清淡的皮蛋肉丸鲜锅烫//加了两份粉进去的麻辣肠衣//在机场被没收的辣椒酱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsd9hIuka0oEEiQdU2NyzO7ubKLE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>没有登阁的滕王阁//背诵滕王阁序免门票//流利的背诵小朋友</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKDKlqxO7DjgF_Pw_X9ArwvCpQN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>再返蛤蟆街//白糖糕//皮蛋馄饨//味道不好的茶树菇排骨汤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq98MufX1aH41hbkHx8UFblycmJc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>胜利镇江汤包店//吨吨吃糊羹被围观//价格贵但味道还不错</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7xAKKOGQwbrcr0D6nEF-yG5MvI.png"></figure>]]></description>
