  <item>
    <title>2. 泰国游记：普吉岛、佛统、芭提雅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65920c61bf3589e89480bcc4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65920c61bf3589e89480bcc4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:50:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第二期终于来啦！冬天越冷，就越怀念泰国的夏天。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>普吉岛</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>7-11</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a></span><br><span>榴莲糯米饭（普吉岛限定）//各种味道的泡面//湿炒牛河</span><br><span> </span><br><span>见闻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a></span><br><span>掌握各国语言的商贩//窥探到被伊斯兰束缚的女性</span><br><span> </span><br><span>雨季</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a></span><br><span>在雨季出海//被暴雨打湿的皮皮岛//普吉岛转瞬即逝的大雨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgK_brlvYTMw85H5Ik88yWM12Imq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>芭东海滩感受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a></span><br><span>商业化//叶子//广告//便与不便</span><br><span> </span><br><span>普吉岛餐厅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a></span><br><span>唯一一家餐厅//土耳其菜//甜品</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>佛统</span></strong><br><span>火车站</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a></span><br><span>又小又破//第一次坐蒸汽火车//噪音大</span><br><span>火车站导航：Jaran Sanitwong</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftx0ss5tPLwJxnl6FQrYo3YBXTFj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>佛统集市</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a></span><br><span>土耳其卷饼//超级棒的炒粉//炭火烤肉//独特的小游戏//光盘租赁//宗教仪式随想</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvHxwY1BDdOWvCX5DSp7rI_Y6Lon.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>火焰虾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a></span><br><span>距离远//硕大鲜虾//先炸后烧//目睹布施</span><br><span> </span><br><span>店名及导航地址: Volcano Prawn Restaurant  泰语店名: ร้าน กุ้งอบภูเขาไฟ  泰语地址:885 ถ. เพชรเกษม ตำบลสนามจันทร์ อำเภอเมืองนครปฐม นครปฐม   营业时间: 周一到周四<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a>  周五到周日:<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 大虾泰语: กุ้งตัวใหญ่ 小虾泰语: กุ้งตัวเล็ก 一公斤:หนึ่งกิโล 半公斤:ครึ่งกิโล 点虾时可选择半公斤或一公斤，根据个人需要下单就好。</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>芭提雅</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a></span><br><span>一波三折//海鲜早市//突如其来的乌云//温暖的老板//关心小狗//意外的计划//飞机夜市//Terminal 21//随意闯入的餐厅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgL5V4VyVrCgh52d1vlYxeAZ-kio.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>文化融合</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3046">50:46</a></span><br><span>传统与现代//东方与西方//保守与开放//放弃与坚持</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjdH2VNHA8Wd3HnTF0j3mKp_QZv3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>谢谢你听到这里，祝福各位的泰国之行好玩又好吃：）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljQNUnQ1v76z3C5BSMdDdfvGkQOL.m4a" length="54869286" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fls2gbwDUic4-VD_MRwe7kAfuuXl.png"/>
