  <item>
    <title>1.泰国美食：曼谷夜市路边摊爱好者集合！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6575cd026d7f010fe034c40a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6575cd026d7f010fe034c40a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Dec 2023 14:36:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是猫老师和吨吨的第一篇游记哦，本期节目将邀请大家来到北纬十三度的泰国，希望我们的声音能让听众朋友们暂时忘掉十二月的寒冷，回忆起用勺子挖西瓜的日子，午后在躺椅上惬意挥动芭蕉扇的时间。嗯？好像旁边有冬阴功的味道传来了……</span></p><span></span><p><span>店名、地址和营业时间也一并附上，欢迎大家当作旅行攻略参考：）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 7-11便利店</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>美味馄饨//重口味//罗勒叶炒肉//皮蛋粥踩雷</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 集市</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>卧佛寺吃饭节</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>无意闯入节日//摊主热情的邀请//流连忘返</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸡蛋豆芽//炸鸡翅//鱼丸细粉//猪脚饭//黑色细粉//碎肉细粉//猪肝细粉//各类饮料自取</span></p><span></span><p><span>传教随想</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtVbNrkh7ArPZTHzayJWqkC5OuCM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luXhovAk15pv-kaqdf7TN1lJ_b7M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Jodd Fair</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>火山排骨//味道一般//西式教堂布景</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>导航地址: JODD FAIRS DanNeramit</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>泰语地址:จ๊อดแฟร์ แดนเนรมิตพหลโยธิน 24</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>BTS站: Phahon Yothin 24 พหลโยธิน 24（2号出口）或Ha Yaek Lat Phrao Station ห้าแยกลาดพร้าว（4号出口）</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>MRT: Phahon Yothin พหลโยธิน（3号出口）MRT站走路路程远一点</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>营业时间:每天16PM-12AM</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;吞武里市场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>游泳的海鲜//万物皆可泡饭//交通不便//占地广阔//对面有按摩店</span></p><span></span><p><span>三文鱼//蟹肉鸡蛋盖饭//芒果糯米饭//冬阴功粉//绿色鸡肉炒粉//烤扇贝//奶茶//椰汁//鸡肉串米饭//奶茶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln3jKjUg1PCYIbVRdKCkYyA4ruea.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>导航名字: Thonburi Market Place</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>泰语:ตลาดสดธนบุรี(亦可直接搜中文:吞武里市场)</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>地址:58 ถ. บรมราชชนนี แขวงศาลาธรรมสพน์ เขตทวีวัฒนา กรุงเทพมหานคร</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>营业时间:每天07AM-21PM</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>(建议去的最佳时间是早上10点半到中午这个时间段，因为海鲜刚来最新鲜)</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>公共交通不是很方便，可从市中心直接打车来(约半小时)，亦可坐BTS或MRT到Bang Wa บางหว้า站下后再接着打车(车程约16分钟)。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> &nbsp;暖武里市场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>当心晕船//随心走进餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>船名：Mine Smart Ferry 票价单程20铢 ，沙吞码头（BTS Saphan Taksin）登船</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> &nbsp;陶瓷岛</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>30秒船程</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰子饼椰子糕//泰式炒河粉//冬阴功面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj5unP1mNglJrVk3-iog92b7Ib1g.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>小岛名字:Ko Kret เกาะเกร็ด</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>导航到这个庙里的码头登船:Wat Sanam Nuea วัดสนามเหนือ</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>英语地址:24 Chaeng Watthana Rd, Tambon Pak Kret, Pak Kret District, Nonthaburi</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>泰语地址:24 ถ. แจ้งวัฒนะ ตำบล ปากเกร็ด อำเภอปากเกร็ด นนทบุรี</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> 随心走进的夜市</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> 楼下烤鸡腿</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>炭烤//外脆里嫩//烟熏</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> 孔提市场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>便宜的水果</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fno63VPm7GM-V73dnS6I1Dyp5jpu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>店铺</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> The Local</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>价格贵//环境好//菜品全//合家欢游客餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a> Pakeaw kailkrob</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>机场旁//外脆里嫩烤鸡腿//椰子布丁//香蕉紫薯糯米饭//价格实惠//离素万那普机场车程10分钟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiUW61CMpCmHXyghMAhN_PMr6zCR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>店名及导航:ป้าแก้ว ไก่ย่างหนังกรอบPakeaw Kaikrob</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>地址:1637 Lat Krabang Rd, Lat Krabang, Bangkok</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>泰语地址:1637 ถนน ลาดกระบัง แขวงลาดกระบัง เขตลาดกระบัง กรุงเทพมหานคร</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>泰语打车: ลาดกระบัง ซอย 13</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>营业时间:每天08AM-21PM</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> Swensens</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>芒果糯米冰淇淋//分布广泛//摩天轮夜市</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 湄南河游船自助餐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>湄南河夜景//选择丰富</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 下期预告</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>佛统/芭提雅/普吉岛</span></p>]]></description>
